 us company\, and the Supreme Court struck down bus segregation.\n\nThe les
 son: Your money is a vote. Spend it like one.\n\nEvery card in the game's 
 History deck is true. getcivicarmor.com/play\n\n#BlackHistory #ReadTheMach
 ine #CivicArmor #TheSecondNumber
